// layeredPaperEditorial() above was the only other hand-authored, full-depth
// DNA. These fill the actual 2D-animation-technique gap. Each is authored
// to this same full depth (not the thin legacyStyleToDna() wrapper) so the
// character/environment/prop-context prompt blocks (see stylePromptBlocks())
// have real, specific guidance to draw on.
